1
00:00:01,500 --> 00:00:17,100
[Host] Welcome to Japanese Daily News. I'm Maya. Today is June ninth. Tonight, Nintendo is holding one of its famous Direct broadcasts, where they reveal new games to fans all around the world. Let's listen.

2
00:00:17,699 --> 00:00:20,460
[News] 今日のニュースです。

3
00:00:21,160 --> 00:00:28,167
[News] 任天堂が、「ニンテンドーダイレクト」という番組を放送します。

4
00:00:28,867 --> 00:00:34,795
[News] これは、新しいゲームの情報を伝える番組です。

5
00:00:35,496 --> 00:00:41,423
[News] 放送は、6月9日の夜11時からです。

6
00:00:42,124 --> 00:00:47,475
[News] 番組の時間は、だいたい50分くらいです。

7
00:00:48,176 --> 00:00:53,240
[News] インターネットで、だれでも見ることができます。

8
00:00:53,939 --> 00:01:01,932
[News] 今回は、2026年の後半に出るゲームを中心に紹介します。

9
00:01:02,631 --> 00:01:09,016
[News] ニンテンドースイッチ2と、スイッチのソフトの情報があります。

10
00:01:09,715 --> 00:01:15,811
[News] 任天堂のゲームは、世界中でとても人気があります。

11
00:01:16,512 --> 00:01:22,584
[News] 新しいゲームを楽しみにしている人が、たくさんいます。

12
00:01:23,284 --> 00:01:29,427
[News] どんなゲームが発表されるか、みんな楽しみにしています。

13
00:01:30,128 --> 00:01:31,760
[Host] Let's break it down.

14
00:01:32,359 --> 00:01:40,376
[Slow] 任天堂が、「ニンテンドーダイレクト」という番組を放送します。

15
00:01:41,176 --> 00:01:45,495
[Host] Nintendo is broadcasting a program called Nintendo Direct.

16
00:01:46,096 --> 00:01:48,400
[Vocab] 番組

17
00:01:48,799 --> 00:01:55,352
[Host] It means a TV or online program — a show. You'll hear it for anything from news to variety shows.

18
00:01:55,951 --> 00:02:02,719
[Slow] これは、新しいゲームの情報を伝える番組です。

19
00:02:03,519 --> 00:02:07,456
[Host] This is a program that shares information about new games.

20
00:02:08,056 --> 00:02:10,479
[Vocab] 情報

21
00:02:10,879 --> 00:02:16,759
[Host] It means information. Think of it whenever you're looking something up or getting the latest news.

22
00:02:17,360 --> 00:02:24,151
[Slow] 放送は、6月9日の夜11時からです。

23
00:02:24,951 --> 00:02:28,599
[Host] The broadcast starts at eleven at night on June ninth.

24
00:02:29,199 --> 00:02:31,599
[Vocab] 放送

25
00:02:32,000 --> 00:02:38,792
[Host] It means a broadcast, or to broadcast. Add the verb for to do, and it becomes to air something.

26
00:02:39,391 --> 00:02:45,512
[Slow] 番組の時間は、だいたい50分くらいです。

27
00:02:46,312 --> 00:02:49,168
[Host] The program runs about fifty minutes.

28
00:02:49,768 --> 00:02:52,000
[Vocab] だいたい

29
00:02:52,400 --> 00:02:57,704
[Host] It means roughly, or about. A handy word when you don't need an exact number.

30
00:02:58,304 --> 00:03:07,448
[Slow] 今回は、2026年の後半に出るゲームを中心に紹介します。

31
00:03:08,247 --> 00:03:14,367
[Host] This time, they'll mainly introduce games coming out in the second half of 2026.

32
00:03:14,967 --> 00:03:17,151
[Vocab] 後半

33
00:03:17,551 --> 00:03:23,312
[Host] It means the latter half, or second half. The opposite word is the first half.

34
00:03:23,912 --> 00:03:30,872
[Slow] 任天堂のゲームは、世界中でとても人気があります。

35
00:03:31,671 --> 00:03:35,608
[Host] Nintendo's games are very popular all over the world.

36
00:03:36,207 --> 00:03:38,439
[Vocab] 人気

37
00:03:38,840 --> 00:03:46,039
[Host] It means popularity. Pair it with the verb for to exist, and you're saying something is popular, or well-liked.

38
00:03:46,639 --> 00:03:53,575
[Slow] 新しいゲームを楽しみにしている人が、たくさんいます。

39
00:03:54,376 --> 00:03:57,639
[Host] There are many people looking forward to the new games.

40
00:03:58,240 --> 00:04:00,568
[Vocab] 楽しみ

41
00:04:00,967 --> 00:04:07,400
[Host] It means something to look forward to. It's a warm, common way to say you can't wait for something.

42
00:04:08,000 --> 00:04:15,008
[Slow] どんなゲームが発表されるか、みんな楽しみにしています。

43
00:04:15,807 --> 00:04:19,216
[Host] Everyone is excited to see what games will be announced.

44
00:04:19,815 --> 00:04:22,240
[Vocab] 発表

45
00:04:22,639 --> 00:04:28,711
[Host] It means an announcement, or to announce. It's used for reveals, results, and news.

46
00:04:29,312 --> 00:04:32,312
[Host] Let's listen to the full story one more time.

47
00:04:32,911 --> 00:04:35,672
[News] 今日のニュースです。

48
00:04:36,372 --> 00:04:43,379
[News] 任天堂が、「ニンテンドーダイレクト」という番組を放送します。

49
00:04:44,079 --> 00:04:50,007
[News] これは、新しいゲームの情報を伝える番組です。

50
