[Slow] 番組の時間は、どのくらいですか。

62
00:06:06,764 --> 00:06:10,339
[Host] How long is the program? About fifty minutes.

63
00:06:10,939 --> 00:06:17,636
[Slow] 今回は、いつ出るゲームを中心に紹介しますか。

64
00:06:18,435 --> 00:06:25,084
[Host] Which games will they mainly introduce this time? Games coming out in the second half of 2026.

65
